  "body": "[Constraint validation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#constraint-validation) only checks submittable elements. So if you do `fieldset.setCustomValidity(\"Something is wrong!\")` this has no impact on preventing form submission.\r\n\r\nI think constraint validation should also check fieldsets?\r\n\r\nThere might be other elements with the constraint validation API added to them but outside the submittable elements list...",
